    "text": "SERMO DE MEMORIA SANCTORUM.\nSpel loca hw\u00e6nne mann wille.\nEGO SUM ALFA ET omega; INITIUM ET FINIS DICIT DOMINUS DEUS, qui est et qui erat et qui\nAn \u00e6lmihtig god is on \u00ferym hadum \u00e6fre wunigende, se\u00fee ealle \u00feincg gesceop.\nNu habbe we anginn \u00feurh hine, for\u00f0an \u00fee he us gesceop \u00fea\u00f0a we n\u00e6ron, and us eft alysde \u00fea \u00fea we\nNu sceole we hogian mid mycelne gymene, \u00fe\u00e6t ure lif beo swa gelogod, \u00fe\u00e6t ure ende geendige on God,\nWe magon niman gode bysne, \u00e6rest be \u00f0am halgum heahf\u00e6derum, hu hi on heora life gode gecwemdon,\n\u00c6rest Abel Adames sunu, w\u00e6s Gode swa gecweme \u00feurh unsce\u00f0\u00feignysse and rihtwisnysse, \u00fe\u00e6t Crist\nEft Enoch, se seofo\u00f0a mann fram Adame, w\u00e6s swa estful on his mode and Gode swa gelicwur\u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t\nNoe eac for his rihtwisnysse ofercom \u00fe\u00e6t miccle flod \u00fee ealne middaneard ofereode swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0urh hine\nAbraham for his micclan geleafan to Gode, and for his gehyrsumnysse underfeng swilce bletsunge \u00e6t\nEft Iacob Isaaces sunu, for his geswincum so\u00f0lice wear\u00f0 gebletsod \u00e6rest \u00e6t his f\u00e6der, and si\u00f0\u00f0an \u00e6t\nAnd mid \u00f0am naman w\u00e6ron \u00fea getacnode, \u00fee nu on Cristendome \u00f0uruh geleafan God geseo\u00f0.\nIob se eadiga and se anr\u00e6da Godes \u00f0egn, w\u00e6s swa fulfremed on eallum godnyssum \u00fe\u00e6t god sylf cw\u00e6\u00f0\n\u00dea b\u00e6d se deofol \u00e6t Gode \u00fe\u00e6t he moste his fandian, hw\u00e6\u00f0er he \u00f0urhwunian wolde on his godnysse and\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a se deofol anes deges ealle his \u00e6hta acwealde, and his seofon suna and \u00f0reo dohtra, and hine\nAc se anr\u00e6da Iob nolde n\u00e6fre abugan fram Godes lufe, ne for ehtnysse ne for untrumnysse ne for his\nGod hine \u00f0a geh\u00e6lde fram \u00f0am egeslican broce, and his \u00e6hta him forgeald ealle be twifealdum, and he\nDauid for his man\u00fewyrnysse and mildheortnysse wear\u00f0 Gode gecweme and to cynincge gecoren, swa\nEft Helias se \u00e6\u00f0ela witega, for\u00f0an \u00fee he wan wi\u00f0 unrihtwisnysse, wear\u00f0 on heofenlicum cr\u00e6te to\nEac swilce \u00fea \u00f0ry cnihtas on Chaldea lande, Sidraac, Misaac, and Abdenago, \u00fee for \u00f0an so\u00f0an geleafan\nEal swa eft Danihel se deorwur\u00f0a witega, for his anfealdnysse and anr\u00e6dum geleafan wear\u00f0 tua\nManega o\u00f0re heahf\u00e6deras and halige witegan w\u00e6ron wuldorfulle weras, and wundra gefremedon on\nEft us secga\u00f0 bec hu \u00f0a synfullan forferdon and \u00f0a arleasan \u00e6fre for heora yfelnysse losodon, for\u00f0an \u00fee\nNe eft \u00f0a arleasan \u00fee hine mid yfelnysse gremia\u00f0, ne magon n\u00e6fre \u00e6twindan \u00f0am ecum witum ahwar.\nEft on \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes tocyme wear\u00f0 se halga Iohannes \u00e6tforan him asend swa swa heofonlic bydel, \u00fe\u00e6t\nWitegung and seo ealde \u00e6 wunodon o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t, and Iohannes astealde \u00fea sti\u00f0an drohtnunge on \u00fe\u00e6re niwan\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a ure H\u00e6lend, \u00fe\u00e6s heofonlican Godes sunu, cydde his mycclan lufe \u00fee he to us mannum\nBe \u00feam we magon tocnawan Cristes eadmodnysse, \u00fe\u00e6t se healica God hine sylfne swa geeadmette,\nHe is ofer ealle \u00feincg \u00e6lmihtig scyppend, and he wolde swa\u00f0eah wite \u00f0rowian for us.\nNu is his eadmodnys us unwi\u00f0metenlic, for\u00f0an \u00fee we synd synfulle and sceolan beon eadmode, wille\nNe het he us na leornian heofonas to wyrcenne, ac het us beon eadmode \u00fe\u00e6t we to heofonum\nCrist clypode on his bodunge, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to eallum mannum, Penitentiam agite, adpropinquabit enim\nCrist ferde \u00f0a abutan geond \u00fea Iudeiscan byrig bodigende godspel, and \u00f0a blindan onlihte and ealle\nHis hlisa asprang \u00fea to Syrian lande, and man ferode untrume menn feorran and nean, myslice\n\u00deas ylcan mihte he forgeaf his m\u00e6ran apostolum, \u00fe\u00e6t hi mihton geh\u00e6lan on \u00f0\u00e6s h\u00e6lendes naman\nTwelf apostolas w\u00e6ron \u00fee wunedon mid him, and twa and hundseofontig he geceas him to bydelum,\n\u00deas feower and hundeahtatig \u00fee folgodon \u00f0am H\u00e6lende synd \u00f0a grundweallas on Godes gela\u00f0unge,\nHit gelamp \u00fea sume d\u00e6g, \u00f0a \u00f0a se H\u00e6lend si\u00f0ode, \u00fe\u00e6t sum man him cw\u00e6\u00f0 to, Ic wille si\u00feian mid \u00f0e,\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend him to, Foxas habba\u00f0 holu, and fugelas habba\u00f0 nest, and ic n\u00e6bbe wununge\nCrist sceawode his heortan and geseah his pr\u00e6ttas, for\u00f0an \u00fee he mid so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse ne sohte \u00feone\nCrist eft \u00fea si\u00f0\u00f0an cw\u00e6\u00f0 to sumum o\u00f0rum, Fylig me on minre fare, and he afyrht andwyrde, L\u00e6t me\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Crist to \u00feam menn eft, Ge\u00feafa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea deadan heora deadan bebyrion, gang \u00f0u sylf so\u00f0lice,\n\u00dea synd so\u00f0lice deade \u00fee heora scyppende ne \u00f0eowia\u00f0, and \u00f0a \u00fee Godes beboda mid biggengum ne\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 sum \u00feridda man to Criste eft \u00f0us, ic wylle fylian \u00fee leof, ac l\u00e6t me \u00e6rest faran, and cy\u00f0an\nHim andwyrde \u00feus se h\u00e6lend, Gif se yr\u00f0lincg behylt underb\u00e6c gelome, ne bi\u00f0 he gelimplic tilia.\n\u00de\u00e6t is on \u00f0isum andgite, Swa swa se yr\u00f0lincg amyr\u00f0 his furuh gif he loca\u00f0 to lange underb\u00e6c, swa eac\nM\u00e6nigfealde w\u00e6ron \u00fe\u00e6s H\u00e6lendes wundra, and his halige lar swa we leornia\u00f0 on bocum, and ealle\nEft \u00e6fter his \u00e6riste and upstige to heofonum, \u00fea\u00fea se geleafa aras and man alede deofolgyld, \u00fea\nSe arleasa deofol, \u00fee is \u00e6fre embe yfel, astyrode \u00fea ehtnysse \u00f0urh arlease cwelleras, and wolde mid\nEft \u00f0a\u00f0a God sealde sibbe his gela\u00f0unge, \u00fe